#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:2
msgid "Creating Visualization Markers"
msgstr "创建可视化标记"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:6
msgid ""
"Visualization markers render debug geometry (frames, arrows, spheres, custom"
" meshes) over the scene through :class:`markers.VisualizationMarkers`. "
"Markers are display-only: they carry no physics and do not affect the "
"simulation."
msgstr ""
"可视化标记通过 :class:`markers.VisualizationMarkers` "
"在场景中显示调试几何体，包括坐标系、箭头、球体和自定义网格。标记仅用于显示，不具有物理属性，也不影响仿真。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:10
msgid ""
"For plain points, lines, and splines, Isaac Sim's own "
":mod:`isaacsim.util.debug_draw` extension is lighter-weight. Use "
"``VisualizationMarkers`` when you need more complex shapes."
msgstr ""
"对于简单的点、线和样条，Isaac Sim 的 :mod:`isaacsim.util.debug_draw` 扩展更轻量。需要复杂形状时，使用 "
"``VisualizationMarkers`` 。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:13
msgid ""
"Supported on Kit, Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser; not yet on Newton RTX. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/visualization` for enabling markers on a given "
"visualizer."
msgstr ""
"支持 Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 Viser，暂不支持 Newton RTX。在指定可视化器中启用标记的方法见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/visualization` 。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:18
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:20
msgid "This guide is accompanied by the packaged ``markers`` example."
msgstr "本指南配套提供打包的 ``markers`` 示例。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:36
msgid ""
"Pass ``--visualizer newton_gl`` (or another supported backend) to switch "
"visualizers; defaults to ``kit``."
msgstr "传入 ``--visualizer newton_gl`` 或其他受支持后端，可切换可视化器；默认为 ``kit`` 。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:42
msgid ""
"Every marker prototype from the example script, arranged in a grid. Each "
"column rotates in place and periodically rolls forward to the next "
"prototype."
msgstr "示例脚本中的全部标记原型按网格排列。各列原地旋转，并定期向前轮换到下一个原型。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:45
msgid "To stop, close the window or press ``Ctrl+C``."
msgstr "关闭窗口或按 ``Ctrl+C`` 可停止。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:0
msgid "Code for markers.py"
msgstr "markers.py 的代码"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:56
msgid "Configuring markers"
msgstr "配置标记"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:58
msgid ":class:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg` takes:"
msgstr ":class:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg` 接受："

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:60
msgid ""
":attr:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg.prim_path`: prim path where the "
"marker ``UsdGeom.PointInstancer`` is created."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg.prim_path` ：创建标记 "
"``UsdGeom.PointInstancer`` 的 prim 路径。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:62
msgid ""
":attr:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg.markers`: a dict of marker "
"prototypes. The key names the prototype; the value is its spawn config (any "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.SpawnerCfg`, including USD file references)."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~markers.VisualizationMarkersCfg.markers` ：标记原型字典，键是原型名称，值是生成配置，可以是任意"
" :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.SpawnerCfg` ，包括 USD 文件引用。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:68
msgid ""
"Physics properties on a marker prototype's spawn config are stripped on "
"creation, since markers are not simulated."
msgstr "由于标记不参与仿真，创建时会移除其原型生成配置中的物理属性。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:77
msgid "Drawing markers"
msgstr "绘制标记"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:79
msgid ""
":meth:`~markers.VisualizationMarkers.visualize` sets marker poses and, "
"optionally, which prototype each marker instance uses via "
"``marker_indices``."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~markers.VisualizationMarkers.visualize` 设置标记位姿，还可通过 "
"``marker_indices`` 指定各标记实例使用的原型。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:88
msgid ""
"Arguments left as ``None`` keep their previous value. Passing a different "
"number of rows than the last call resizes the marker instance count. See "
":meth:`~markers.VisualizationMarkers.visualize`'s docstring for the full "
"argument list (``translations``, ``orientations``, ``scales``, "
"``marker_indices``, ``environment_ids``)."
msgstr ""
"参数保持 ``None`` 时，沿用之前的值。传入行数与上次不同，会调整标记实例数量。完整参数列表（ ``translations`` 、 "
"``orientations`` 、 ``scales`` 、 ``marker_indices`` 、 ``environment_ids`` ）见 "
":meth:`~markers.VisualizationMarkers.visualize` 的文档字符串。"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:95
msgid "Markers in practice"
msgstr "标记的实际应用"

#: source/features/draw_markers.rst:97
msgid ""
"Markers are commonly used to debug per-environment state during training, "
"such as commanded vs. current velocity, or contact events:"
msgstr "标记常用于训练期间调试各环境状态，例如比较指令速度与当前速度，或显示接触事件："

